WEBVTT

00:06.110 --> 00:07.150
<b>Where is this?</b>

00:08.250 --> 00:11.160
<b>What are these animals?</b>

00:11.160 --> 00:12.370
<b>So, you have awoken.</b>

00:13.470 --> 00:15.490
<b>As far as I can tell,
you seem to be unharmed.</b>

00:15.800 --> 00:17.460
<b>What happened to that vampire?</b>

00:17.460 --> 00:19.470
<b>What the hell happened?</b>

00:19.470 --> 00:21.920
<b>It seems as though he has disappeared.</b>

00:22.350 --> 00:25.380
<b>Evidently, we have been brought
to the outskirts of this town.</b>

00:26.520 --> 00:28.510
<b>What is their purpose?</b>

00:30.570 --> 00:32.890
<b>I don't see Watcher.</b>

00:34.320 --> 00:36.560
<b>You're awake.</b>

00:36.730 --> 00:40.520
<b>We were just talking about
whether or not to carry you onto a bed.</b>

00:41.080 --> 00:43.440
<b>I believe my daughter found you both...</b>

00:43.440 --> 00:45.480
<b>collapsed in the garden.</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:47.780
<b>You are...</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:52.030
<b>I am Tsubaki Kuruoka!</b>

02:23.350 --> 02:26.790
<b>Now, go ahead and speak up, Richard.</b>

02:26.790 --> 02:31.550
<b>Why did you sneak out of the castle
without permission so late at night?</b>

02:31.550 --> 02:33.130
<b>Mother...</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:35.260
<b>I am afraid.</b>

02:35.260 --> 02:36.010
<b>That's...</b>

02:36.010 --> 02:37.300
<b>Saber?</b>

02:37.610 --> 02:39.810
<b>This is his past?</b>

02:39.980 --> 02:41.970
<b>Afraid? Of what?</b>

02:42.410 --> 02:45.310
<b>That I am able to become
proficient at everything.</b>

02:45.310 --> 02:47.150
<b>I can do anything well.</b>

02:47.500 --> 02:51.150
<b>There is not a man who can win
against me in swordsmanship.</b>

02:51.150 --> 02:53.650
<b>I had thought they were 
all going easy on me,</b>

02:53.650 --> 02:57.950
<b>so I snuck out of the castle and attacked
bandits infamous for their violence!</b>

02:57.950 --> 02:59.370
<b>Oh my.</b>

02:59.370 --> 03:02.790
<b>However, I easily trounced them.</b>

03:03.140 --> 03:07.290
<b>No matter what skill I take up,
I master it immediately.</b>

03:07.810 --> 03:12.000
<b>People soon become unable
to win against me in contests.</b>

03:12.350 --> 03:15.420
<b>At this rate, I will not be able
to make a single friend.</b>

03:15.420 --> 03:21.240
<b>Is it better if I go easy on them and
pretend as if I am not adept at anything?</b>

03:21.240 --> 03:22.970
<b>Man, he has no charm.</b>

03:24.570 --> 03:27.190
<b>You said you wouldn't laugh, Mother!</b>

03:27.830 --> 03:32.150
<b>Richard, you are indeed a genius.</b>

03:32.150 --> 03:33.070
<b>However...</b>

03:33.070 --> 03:37.360
<b>being a genius alone will 
not make you a hero.</b>

03:37.360 --> 03:39.030
<b>A hero, you say?</b>

03:39.210 --> 03:43.080
<b>Just how King Arthur and the
Knights of the Round Table were as such,</b>

03:43.080 --> 03:48.250
<b>people only become heroes
after staying firm to their own path.</b>

03:48.640 --> 03:52.710
<b>So, if you truly are 
able to do everything...</b>

03:53.230 --> 03:56.840
<b>cherish the ability to pass on stories.</b>

03:57.360 --> 03:59.340
<b>Pass on...</b>

03:59.340 --> 04:01.430
<b>Now, I shall tell you...</b>

04:01.630 --> 04:04.390
<b>the story of the King of Knights who raced</b>

04:04.390 --> 04:06.310
<b>through Britain with
a sacred sword in hand!</b>

04:07.200 --> 04:09.400
<b>But before that...</b>

04:09.400 --> 04:12.230
<b>As a mother, I must reprimand you...</b>

04:12.230 --> 04:15.320
<b>for leaving the castle without permission.</b>

04:19.170 --> 04:20.530
<b>Ayaka?</b>

04:21.630 --> 04:22.990
<b>Are you okay?</b>

04:23.800 --> 04:24.830
<b>Adult...</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:25.870
<b>Wha...</b>

04:26.550 --> 04:28.010
<b>Ow!</b>

04:28.010 --> 04:29.710
<b>A-Are you all right?</b>

04:30.600 --> 04:33.470
<b>What about you, Saber? Are you okay?</b>

04:33.470 --> 04:34.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:34.630 --> 04:36.460
<b>Not perfect, but I can move around.</b>

04:36.810 --> 04:38.380
<b>Healing Magecraft by our allies—</b>

04:38.380 --> 04:40.560
<b>The reason you left me at the Church...</b>

04:40.560 --> 04:44.690
<b>was because they could protect me
when you died, wasn't it?</b>

04:44.690 --> 04:45.560
<b>Oh...</b>

04:45.560 --> 04:47.140
<b>My apologies.</b>

04:47.140 --> 04:49.160
<b>If you have time to worry about me,</b>

04:49.160 --> 04:51.600
<b>then you can take
better care of yourself, Saber!</b>

04:51.600 --> 04:54.520
<b>I mean, that thing earlier...
You should have been able to dodge it.</b>

04:57.250 --> 04:59.150
<b>The ceiling has been repaired.</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:01.700
<b>Is this your Magecraft, too, Saber?</b>

05:01.700 --> 05:03.270
<b>If I could do such a thing,</b>

05:03.270 --> 05:05.990
<b>I would have fixed
that opera house long ago.</b>

05:05.990 --> 05:07.740
<b>There are things I can't do, you know.</b>

05:09.930 --> 05:13.540
<b>"Mother, I am able to become
proficient at everything."</b>

05:13.540 --> 05:15.040
<b>Or you said.</b>

05:15.750 --> 05:17.420
<b>You saw that?</b>

05:18.020 --> 05:19.630
<b>Your mom was really pretty.</b>

05:22.440 --> 05:24.180
<b>A-Are you okay?</b>

05:24.180 --> 05:28.690
<b>I hear that a Master can have dreams
about a Servant's past!</b>

05:28.690 --> 05:32.310
<b>Saber, do you still think 
you can do anything?</b>

05:32.490 --> 05:35.480
<b>I mean, you actually don't
look like you're terrible</b>

05:35.480 --> 05:37.900
<b>at anything other than reading the room.</b>

05:37.900 --> 05:39.650
<b>That's going a bit too far!</b>

05:39.830 --> 05:43.030
<b>There were things I was 
not able to do in life!</b>

05:43.030 --> 05:44.030
<b>Like what?</b>

05:44.460 --> 05:45.870
<b>English.</b>

05:45.870 --> 05:47.030
<b>Huh?</b>

05:47.030 --> 05:49.080
<b>I was terrible at English!</b>

05:49.080 --> 05:51.580
<b>And I was the King of England!</b>

05:55.290 --> 05:56.790
<b>Ayaka!</b>

05:56.790 --> 05:58.750
<b>Laughing about what people 
are not good at—</b>

05:58.750 --> 05:59.750
<b>Saber...</b>

05:59.750 --> 06:00.840
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:01.690 --> 06:03.720
<b>I'm glad you're still alive.</b>

06:09.360 --> 06:11.360
<b>All right! Switching gears!</b>

06:11.360 --> 06:15.020
<b>Now that you know my past embarrassment,
there is nothing left to lose!</b>

06:15.020 --> 06:18.190
<b>I can even win against 
that golden one next time!</b>

06:18.190 --> 06:21.070
<b>And no matter what you tell me,
I will protect you, as well!</b>

06:21.070 --> 06:24.780
<b>Because I am a man who can
become proficient at everything!</b>

06:29.760 --> 06:31.120
<b>Saber...</b>

06:31.120 --> 06:32.660
<b>and Ayaka Sajyou?</b>

06:33.350 --> 06:35.120
<b>You all are...</b>

06:36.930 --> 06:38.290
<b>Hey, John...</b>

06:38.290 --> 06:40.590
<b>There really is nothing 
wrong with your body?</b>

06:40.980 --> 06:43.710
<b>And that thing earlier... That power...</b>

06:44.190 --> 06:46.300
<b>I had a peculiar dream.</b>

06:46.300 --> 06:47.050
<b>A dream?</b>

06:47.230 --> 06:48.510
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:48.510 --> 06:50.620
<b>I don't really understand it myself...</b>

06:50.620 --> 06:52.390
<b>but one thing is for certain.</b>

06:52.570 --> 06:56.520
<b>The author Caster gave me some strength.</b>

06:59.500 --> 07:01.150
<b>This is...</b>

07:01.150 --> 07:05.780
<b>The signs of combat are completely gone
from this part of town.</b>

07:06.590 --> 07:11.450
<b>We are likely quarantined within a realm
similar to a Reality Marble.</b>

07:11.760 --> 07:13.540
<b>"Reality Marble"?</b>

07:13.540 --> 07:17.620
<b>We would like to suggest
a temporary joining of forces...</b>

07:17.620 --> 07:21.340
<b>in order to escape.</b>

07:21.850 --> 07:25.170
<b>To think they'd set their daughter up
to become a Master...</b>

07:25.170 --> 07:29.550
<b>And Tsubaki Kuruoka's Servant
caused this incident?</b>

07:29.860 --> 07:31.100
<b>Correct.</b>

07:31.100 --> 07:32.470
<b>Plus...</b>

07:32.470 --> 07:34.180
<b>there was the mysterious Magecraft</b>

07:34.180 --> 07:36.390
<b>that made everyone
on the scene disappear at once.</b>

07:36.740 --> 07:41.860
<b>Some of the Servants managed to escape,
but most of them were swallowed whole.</b>

07:42.170 --> 07:47.820
<b>On top of it, a Servant powerful enough
to annihilate the King of Heroes showed up.</b>

07:56.550 --> 07:59.540
<b>Have you come to defeat the king?</b>

07:59.970 --> 08:01.380
<b>I did not.</b>

08:01.380 --> 08:02.080
<b>Then...</b>

08:02.440 --> 08:04.590
<b>are you here to pass judgment on me?</b>

08:05.020 --> 08:09.300
<b>I, who has tarnished the dignity
of your close friend, the king.</b>

08:09.300 --> 08:11.840
<b>That's not it, either.</b>

08:11.840 --> 08:14.160
<b>Do you know about me?</b>

08:14.160 --> 08:16.770
<b>The king said you were a friend.</b>

08:17.490 --> 08:21.350
<b>I can only think of
one hero who my king calls</b>

08:21.350 --> 08:23.820
<b>"a friend" and compares
his strength against.</b>

08:24.620 --> 08:28.610
<b>If you're thinking I've come
to save King Gilgamesh,</b>

08:28.610 --> 08:30.450
<b>I'm unable to meet those expectations.</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:33.530
<b>If you are the king's friend—</b>

08:33.530 --> 08:35.410
<b>It's because I am his friend.</b>

08:35.800 --> 08:39.190
<b>Gil and I spent irreplaceable 
days together.</b>

08:39.190 --> 08:42.500
<b>An eternal farewell
and the sadness that comes with it...</b>

08:42.500 --> 08:45.010
<b>are already done and over with.</b>

08:45.010 --> 08:50.300
<b>If I were the one laying there,
Gil would not be shedding tears.</b>

08:50.300 --> 08:52.430
<b>Nor would I want such a thing.</b>

08:52.780 --> 08:55.850
<b>You can revile me
as much as you want...</b>

08:55.850 --> 08:57.470
<b>if that will provide
peace of mind.</b>

08:57.650 --> 08:58.980
<b>That's not it.</b>

08:59.580 --> 09:01.060
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:01.060 --> 09:02.850
<b>I do not have a grudge against you.</b>

09:03.250 --> 09:05.900
<b>I didn't do anything!</b>

09:06.370 --> 09:08.570
<b>You used two Command Spells.</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:11.530
<b>One to bring him back.</b>

09:11.530 --> 09:13.780
<b>One to attempt treatment.</b>

09:13.780 --> 09:16.700
<b>That is a good decision as a Master.</b>

09:17.140 --> 09:22.460
<b>The reason I came was because I wanted
to know a bit more about the two of you.</b>

09:22.810 --> 09:24.080
<b>About us?</b>

09:24.560 --> 09:30.050
<b>Gil made no attempt to kill the one who
was trying to use him, so I got curious.</b>

09:30.220 --> 09:34.260
<b>I thought I'd be able to lend a hand
to a Master like that.</b>

09:35.070 --> 09:37.810
<b>In order to get rid of that fiendish god.</b>

09:38.160 --> 09:41.980
<b>Well, it's not bad for a temporary shrine.</b>

09:41.980 --> 09:44.940
<b>Ishtar, the goddess of Venus...</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:49.820
<b>I thought beings with full Divinity
could not be summoned in a Holy Grail War.</b>

09:49.820 --> 09:52.900
<b>Yes, you're right.
Ordinarily, you can't with a Holy Grail.</b>

09:53.420 --> 09:58.660
<b>I manifested because the powers
I had left behind were activated.</b>

09:58.660 --> 10:00.750
<b>Why did you do such a thing?</b>

10:00.750 --> 10:04.710
<b>I burned a blessing onto the world.</b>

10:05.220 --> 10:10.590
<b>If that disrespectful king and cheeky doll
were to meet once again...</b>

10:10.590 --> 10:13.590
<b>I will use all of my 
divine body and soul...</b>

10:13.590 --> 10:16.760
<b>to protect humans!</b>

10:18.240 --> 10:19.220
<b>Damn!</b>

10:19.610 --> 10:21.680
<b>What the hell is he doing?</b>

10:22.070 --> 10:24.770
<b>What about contacting Miss Tohsaka?</b>

10:24.770 --> 10:26.270
<b>Lady...</b>

10:26.270 --> 10:29.900
<b>do you think Miss Tohsaka
will resolve this problem?</b>

10:29.900 --> 10:33.990
<b>I can bet that very devil
will amplify the problem!</b>

10:34.570 --> 10:36.360
<b>That idiot...</b>

10:36.360 --> 10:38.810
<b>If it turns out that he
dozed off for all of this,</b>

10:38.810 --> 10:40.530
<b>he will never hear the end of it!</b>

10:42.800 --> 10:44.120
<b>Oh!</b>

10:44.120 --> 10:45.790
<b>Did you find something out?</b>

10:45.970 --> 10:48.630
<b>Roulettes are lighter than I thought!</b>

10:49.350 --> 10:50.960
<b>I see.</b>

10:50.960 --> 10:53.470
<b>I couldn't think that far.</b>

10:53.470 --> 10:55.550
<b>Oh, how was it?</b>

10:55.550 --> 10:58.180
<b>It seems there is electricity.</b>

10:59.030 --> 11:00.600
<b>What about your end?</b>

11:00.600 --> 11:03.980
<b>We couldn't find any core for creating
a bounded field in the surrounding area.</b>

11:04.150 --> 11:06.940
<b>Perhaps it is hidden in 
a very clever manner.</b>

11:06.940 --> 11:11.860
<b>Once we can find that, there might be
something we can do about this.</b>

11:12.210 --> 11:15.900
<b>I'm planning on heading 
up to the top floor.</b>

11:15.900 --> 11:17.570
<b>You think the core is there?</b>

11:17.880 --> 11:21.530
<b>Hmm, well, I'd be lucky 
if it was up there.</b>

11:22.090 --> 11:25.500
<b>But I was hoping to find a place
that's not so well-guarded.</b>

11:29.520 --> 11:33.210
<b>Mister, Miss, I'm glad you got all better!</b>

11:34.440 --> 11:35.760
<b>You have our thanks.</b>

11:35.760 --> 11:37.430
<b>Yeah. You helped us out.</b>

11:39.440 --> 11:40.800
<b>What's that thing?</b>

11:40.800 --> 11:42.720
<b>Oh! Mr. Black!</b>

11:43.160 --> 11:45.100
<b>Mr.... Black?</b>

11:45.100 --> 11:45.930
<b>Yep!</b>

11:46.140 --> 11:47.850
<b>He's my friend!</b>

11:50.660 --> 11:52.230
<b>Come over here.</b>

11:52.230 --> 11:55.190
<b>Is that really a Heroic Spirit?</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:58.030
<b>Is it possible it's a demonic creature
or some kind of phantom?</b>

11:58.030 --> 12:02.010
<b>No. I can't feel any conscience
from that being,</b>

12:02.010 --> 12:03.910
<b>let alone ill will or hatred.</b>

12:05.140 --> 12:07.660
<b>Those parents are Mages.</b>

12:07.660 --> 12:12.170
<b>Even if under mental domination,
we might get some information if we talk.</b>

12:12.340 --> 12:13.790
<b>He got away!</b>

12:13.790 --> 12:15.170
<b>What's wrong?</b>

12:15.170 --> 12:15.920
<b>No.</b>

12:17.060 --> 12:18.510
<b>It's nothing.</b>

12:19.110 --> 12:21.010
<b>No clues, huh?</b>

12:21.010 --> 12:22.970
<b><i>We can't even find their corpses.</i></b>

12:23.360 --> 12:26.970
<b><i>A majority of the Clan Calatin's
whereabouts are unknown!</i></b>

12:27.370 --> 12:31.020
<b>The King of Heroes disappeared,
but you look depressed.</b>

12:32.870 --> 12:34.900
<b>I'll contact you later.</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:37.210
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

12:37.210 --> 12:40.240
<b>I was helping out a bit
until a few minutes ago.</b>

12:40.590 --> 12:42.800
<b>If I hadn't taken a step back to observe,</b>

12:42.800 --> 12:45.200
<b>I would've been in that black fog
right about now.</b>

12:45.410 --> 12:46.660
<b>Wha...</b>

12:46.660 --> 12:49.160
<b>I don't remember ever giving such orders!</b>

12:49.160 --> 12:51.880
<b>Yeah. I don't remember 
receiving them, either.</b>

12:51.880 --> 12:54.440
<b>If you, the Servant,
were to be taken down,</b>

12:54.440 --> 12:56.840
<b>that signals the end
of our faction, remember?</b>

12:56.840 --> 12:59.260
<b>You have so many other options...</b>

12:59.260 --> 13:02.090
<b>like recreating a pact
with an unemployed Heroic Spirit.</b>

13:02.270 --> 13:05.680
<b>Are you going to fudge your answer
on that assumption?</b>

13:05.680 --> 13:12.060
<b>If you're the one that set your foot in,
don't be so rash to say that it's over.</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:13.770
<b>You're right.</b>

13:13.980 --> 13:15.650
<b>My apologies.</b>

13:16.330 --> 13:18.860
<b>I like that part about you, ya know!</b>

13:19.250 --> 13:21.570
<b>The cop squad guys are still all right.</b>

13:22.050 --> 13:23.160
<b>How do you know?</b>

13:23.360 --> 13:27.620
<b>It just means there was a Noble Phantasm
that I didn't inform my brother about.</b>

13:28.010 --> 13:29.750
<b>So, how about it, Brother?</b>

13:29.750 --> 13:33.620
<b>I'll go help out if it's 
somewhere I can infiltrate.</b>

13:33.620 --> 13:36.380
<b>I didn't give orders 
for you to go that far.</b>

13:36.380 --> 13:38.680
<b>No, you did!</b>

13:38.680 --> 13:43.220
<b>You requested me
to create weapons for your cop squad.</b>

13:43.220 --> 13:46.350
<b>That means providing 
power in order to fight.</b>

13:46.350 --> 13:50.520
<b>What power can I give 
you guys as an author?</b>

13:50.520 --> 13:52.980
<b>That's right! A story!</b>

13:54.160 --> 13:57.520
<b>What does that have to do
with you risking danger?</b>

13:57.520 --> 13:59.030
<b>John Wingard.</b>

14:00.130 --> 14:01.990
<b>Vera Levitt.</b>

14:01.990 --> 14:03.070
<b>Annie Cuarón.</b>

14:03.630 --> 14:05.410
<b>Don Hawkins.</b>

14:05.410 --> 14:07.030
<b>Chadwick Lee.</b>

14:07.030 --> 14:08.200
<b>Yuki Capote.</b>

14:08.380 --> 14:10.830
<b>Adelina Eisenstein.</b>

14:10.830 --> 14:12.290
<b>Their names...</b>

14:12.290 --> 14:13.920
<b>Not just names, you see?</b>

14:13.920 --> 14:16.300
<b>Faces, voices, origins...</b>

14:16.300 --> 14:19.000
<b>Everything I found out,
they're all in here in their entirety.</b>

14:19.000 --> 14:23.010
<b>You learn all the names
of your subordinates, don't you?</b>

14:23.010 --> 14:27.010
<b>They're all central 
characters in my piece now.</b>

14:27.010 --> 14:30.470
<b>And they're acting out
the most supreme of scenarios.</b>

14:30.470 --> 14:31.350
<b>If that's the case...</b>

14:31.350 --> 14:34.060
<b>you just wanna have front 
row seats to watch...</b>

14:34.060 --> 14:35.810
<b>don't ya?</b>

14:36.870 --> 14:42.110
<b>We believe that in order to escape from
this world, we must defeat the Mage...</b>

14:42.110 --> 14:44.280
<b>who is at the root of all this.</b>

14:44.960 --> 14:45.950
<b>Ms. Vera...</b>

14:45.950 --> 14:47.690
<b>was it?</b>

14:47.690 --> 14:51.160
<b>Do we really have to 
defeat them to get out?</b>

14:51.640 --> 14:54.330
<b>Maybe there's a way to 
secretly and safely escape.</b>

14:54.760 --> 14:56.460
<b>I believe that's difficult.</b>

14:56.460 --> 14:59.460
<b>If you are a Mage yourself,
I think you would understand.</b>

14:59.460 --> 15:02.960
<b>Oh no, I'm not anything like that.</b>

15:02.960 --> 15:06.550
<b>In other words, someone is executing
this great a level of Magecraft!</b>

15:06.980 --> 15:10.350
<b>This is such an amazing bounded field!
The Servants surely are—</b>

15:10.350 --> 15:12.770
<b>Are you really a Servant?</b>

15:12.970 --> 15:15.890
<b>You seem to be pretty relaxed.</b>

15:15.890 --> 15:16.730
<b>You are?</b>

15:17.200 --> 15:19.190
<b>I'm John Wingard.</b>

15:19.360 --> 15:20.540
<b>John...</b>

15:20.540 --> 15:22.150
<b>I see, John!</b>

15:22.540 --> 15:25.110
<b>This is a chance encounter of sorts!
Let's get along, shall we?</b>

15:26.130 --> 15:28.160
<b>Hey, you guys were talking about</b>

15:28.160 --> 15:32.080
<b>eradicating the Mage or Servant
that started all this, right?</b>

15:32.470 --> 15:36.750
<b>There are many of my allies who would be
relatively averse to doing so.</b>

15:36.750 --> 15:38.040
<b>Myself included.</b>

15:38.430 --> 15:41.750
<b>The girl you tried to protect...</b>

15:42.060 --> 15:43.930
<b>Tsubaki, was it?</b>

15:43.930 --> 15:45.460
<b>There's still the possibility...</b>

15:45.980 --> 15:48.800
<b>that the one who locked us in
was that girl's Servant, right?</b>

15:49.360 --> 15:52.970
<b>If that little girl is 
the root of all evil...</b>

15:52.970 --> 15:55.560
<b>will you guys be able to kill her?</b>

15:58.370 --> 15:59.600
<b>Mr. Black...</b>

16:00.330 --> 16:03.570
<b>Do you remember when we first met?</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:07.780
<b><i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i></b>

16:07.950 --> 16:11.620
<b><i>Father, Mother, I'm sorry!</i></b>

16:12.260 --> 16:15.080
<b><i>I will do a proper job!</i></b>

16:15.080 --> 16:16.910
<b><i>I will endure it better!</i></b>

16:17.890 --> 16:19.330
<b><i>So...</i></b>

16:20.060 --> 16:22.210
<b><i>please, don't abandon me!</i></b>

16:30.430 --> 16:31.680
<b>I ASK YOU</b>

16:30.430 --> 16:31.680
<b><i>I ask you.</i></b>

16:32.570 --> 16:34.310
<b><i>Are you...</i></b>

16:34.310 --> 16:35.680
<b><i>my...</i></b>

16:34.680 --> 16:37.020
<b>ARE YOU
MY MASTER?</b>

16:35.680 --> 16:37.020
<b><i>Master?</i></b>

16:37.990 --> 16:39.230
<b><i>Who is it?</i></b>

16:40.080 --> 16:41.520
<b><i>I am...</i></b>

16:41.520 --> 16:43.190
<b><i>Tsubaki Kuruoka.</i></b>

16:43.870 --> 16:46.400
<b>We'll be together forever, right?</b>

16:49.090 --> 16:50.820
<b>Mr. Black?</b>

16:51.380 --> 16:55.160
<b>I'm not saying it's the right 
answer to kill a girl...</b>

16:55.470 --> 16:57.120
<b>nor do I want to kill.</b>

16:57.640 --> 16:58.790
<b>But...</b>

16:58.790 --> 17:02.080
<b>we might end up in a situation
where someone has to do it, right?</b>

17:02.600 --> 17:06.090
<b>I have braced myself for that possibility.</b>

17:06.770 --> 17:08.010
<b>I...</b>

17:08.440 --> 17:09.920
<b>We...</b>

17:11.440 --> 17:13.680
<b>When the time comes, I'll do it.</b>

17:15.660 --> 17:17.220
<b>In the end...</b>

17:17.220 --> 17:20.940
<b>I couldn't be the knight that I adored.</b>

17:21.200 --> 17:22.850
<b>But you guys are different!</b>

17:23.330 --> 17:24.860
<b>You are skilled knights!</b>

17:25.250 --> 17:29.690
<b>Against that fearful bowman,
you fought and survived!</b>

17:29.690 --> 17:31.820
<b>All in order to save a single young girl!</b>

17:32.300 --> 17:37.740
<b>Then you lot must be the kind
that will protect the innocent!</b>

17:38.050 --> 17:39.450
<b>Besides...</b>

17:40.100 --> 17:41.960
<b>after doing <i>that</i> once...</b>

17:41.960 --> 17:43.840
<b>pulling the trigger becomes easier.</b>

17:43.840 --> 17:46.630
<b>I should be the one 
shouldering that burden.</b>

17:46.630 --> 17:48.380
<b>Saber...</b>

17:50.650 --> 17:53.430
<b>It looks like the base for some faction.</b>

17:53.630 --> 17:58.520
<b>This room really feels like 
it's the least guarded.</b>

17:58.690 --> 18:00.770
<b>Right here.</b>

18:00.770 --> 18:03.480
<b>The location closest to 
outside the bounded field.</b>

18:03.830 --> 18:06.150
<b>I only see it as an empty magical circle.</b>

18:06.620 --> 18:07.940
<b>Hmm...</b>

18:07.940 --> 18:13.320
<b>I think that this is a bounded field
"world" that recreated reality.</b>

18:13.320 --> 18:16.280
<b>If the slot machines and 
such aren't moving...</b>

18:16.460 --> 18:20.410
<b>it's not continually reflecting
upon a real-life city...</b>

18:20.410 --> 18:24.870
<b>but copy-pasting the world periodically.</b>

18:25.270 --> 18:30.630
<b>Perhaps something that couldn't be copied
is right here in reality.</b>

18:32.770 --> 18:34.760
<b>Someone... is here.</b>

18:36.720 --> 18:40.140
<b>You really are as always, Gil.</b>

18:40.140 --> 18:45.900
<b>You draw the destiny of the world
even after you have stopped functioning.</b>

18:49.860 --> 18:51.400
<b>What's happening?</b>

18:51.400 --> 18:52.570
<b>I merely serve...</b>

18:52.920 --> 18:55.580
<b>as a tool for someone.</b>

18:55.580 --> 19:00.030
<b>If I were to put it in your words,
I guess I'd be a booster.</b>

19:00.380 --> 19:01.290
<b>Huh?</b>

19:02.390 --> 19:03.750
<b>Something wrong?</b>

19:03.920 --> 19:06.460
<b>It's like we're in a subway train,</b>

19:06.460 --> 19:09.150
<b>but I've got three bars
on my cell reception.</b>

19:09.150 --> 19:10.380
<b>I might be able to do it right now.</b>

19:10.900 --> 19:12.840
<b>Is this an altar?</b>

19:12.840 --> 19:15.130
<b>A simple one at that.</b>

19:15.130 --> 19:19.050
<b>If I can get the cell circuits
and the external forces to...</b>

19:20.660 --> 19:22.180
<b>Got a connection!</b>

19:22.910 --> 19:24.680
<b>Found you!</b>

19:31.500 --> 19:32.400
<b>Ayaka?</b>

19:32.400 --> 19:35.110
<b>What's wrong? You're completely pale.</b>

19:36.750 --> 19:39.240
<b>Saber, you can't.</b>

19:39.240 --> 19:40.370
<b>Ayaka?</b>

19:40.370 --> 19:41.740
<b>I don't plan on</b>

19:41.740 --> 19:46.250
<b>saying or have the right to say
selfish things like, "Don't kill anyone."</b>

19:46.810 --> 19:48.080
<b>But...</b>

19:48.290 --> 19:51.460
<b>you laugh at all times...</b>

19:51.460 --> 19:53.090
<b>and never abandon anyone!</b>

19:53.090 --> 19:55.300
<b>You're different from me!</b>

19:55.690 --> 19:58.170
<b>Even if you ultimately soil those hands,</b>

19:58.170 --> 20:01.140
<b>the fact that you saved me
will not be erased!</b>

20:01.450 --> 20:02.510
<b>So...</b>

20:03.280 --> 20:05.770
<b>"I will do the dirty work"...</b>

20:05.770 --> 20:08.230
<b>is the one thing I don't want you to say.</b>

20:08.790 --> 20:12.440
<b>If you need someone
doing the dirty work, I'll do it.</b>

20:14.540 --> 20:19.820
<b>I'd like to say that you worry
about the trivial things like always...</b>

20:19.820 --> 20:21.160
<b>but that's not the case.</b>

20:21.360 --> 20:23.240
<b>Of course not.</b>

20:23.240 --> 20:26.870
<b>My encounter with you
isn't a trivial matter anymore.</b>

20:28.180 --> 20:31.460
<b>I must risk my life to 
save that girl, then!</b>

20:31.670 --> 20:35.500
<b>In this world, we're 
starting off at the Church!</b>

20:35.500 --> 20:36.710
<b>In place of the priest...</b>

20:37.110 --> 20:39.430
<b>we will protect her!</b>

20:40.030 --> 20:41.550
<b>Church...</b>

20:41.550 --> 20:42.510
<b>Protect...</b>

20:43.990 --> 20:45.510
<b>I...</b>

20:45.510 --> 20:47.770
<b>have met that golden guy—</b>

20:48.790 --> 20:49.980
<b>Ayaka?</b>

20:51.580 --> 20:52.770
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:52.770 --> 20:55.940
<b>We were scouting the city streets
when that beast suddenly...</b>

20:56.120 --> 20:58.070
<b>Beast? It can't be!</b>

21:02.840 --> 21:04.240
<b>What...</b>

21:04.240 --> 21:05.330
<b>is that?</b>

21:09.560 --> 21:13.330
<b>Is everyone going to go 
somewhere else again?</b>

21:13.810 --> 21:15.040
<b>O girl...</b>

21:15.040 --> 21:16.380
<b>can you hear me?</b>

21:16.590 --> 21:18.210
<b>Mr. Black?</b>

21:18.820 --> 21:22.130
<b>Good morning, girl 
bewildered within a dream.</b>

21:22.130 --> 21:23.220
<b>Who are you?</b>

21:23.220 --> 21:25.470
<b>I am Tsubaki Kuruoka.</b>

21:26.070 --> 21:27.640
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:27.640 --> 21:32.940
<b>I am one that was once called
"a god of a particular place."</b>

21:32.940 --> 21:36.820
<b>Nowadays, I'm merely that
which remains of said deity.</b>

21:38.170 --> 21:41.320
<b><i>But really, I'm so glad 
I got through to you!</i></b>

21:41.500 --> 21:44.370
<b>I understand your situation.
For the time being,</b>

21:44.370 --> 21:46.080
<b>I'm fine as long as you're all right.</b>

21:46.510 --> 21:48.330
<b><i>One confirmation, though.</i></b>

21:48.330 --> 21:50.960
<b><i>Did you see Ayaka Sajyou over there?</i></b>

21:50.960 --> 21:53.540
<b>What? Ayaka is over here?</b>

21:53.540 --> 21:58.760
<b>Sajyou has been witnessed in Snowfield
for the past few days.</b>

21:58.960 --> 22:01.220
<b>I contacted her myself.</b>

22:01.220 --> 22:02.340
<b>She is apparently...</b>

22:02.520 --> 22:04.800
<b>in Romania right now.</b>

22:05.280 --> 22:07.970
<b>If so, then...</b>

22:07.970 --> 22:09.970
<b>EPISODE 11</b>

22:08.740 --> 22:09.970
<b>who is this girl?</b>
